          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "This is a JWT token decoding vulnerability where the signature is not verified before the token is decoded. This allows attackers to forge tokens and gain unauthorized access. The application uses the RailsJwtAuth gem which implements JWT authentication without proper signature verification."
